multipleCover -- Multiple coverings of rational curves on Calabi-Yau threefolds
*******************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        multipleCover(d)
  * Inputs:
      * d, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the degree d of a rational
        curve
  * Outputs:
      * a *note rational number: (Macaulay2Doc)QQ,, the contribution of
        multiple coverings of rational curves on Calabi-Yau threefolds

Description
===========

Computes the contribution of multiple coverings of a smooth rational curve as a
Gromov-Witten invariant.



